  "id": "stelazine",
  "term": "Stelazine",
  "definition": "Stelazine is trifluoperazine hydrochloride, a drug that acts on dopamine, alpha-adrenergic, and anticholinergic systems. In mental health contexts, it is described as having antipsychotic and anxiety-reducing effects and may help lessen hallucinations and delusions linked to excess dopamine activity.",
